  "notes": [
    "ATM's setSubContracts pointed blindBoxContract at BlindBox, routing DEAD transfers into bets and granting it internalTransferFrom out of DEAD, which every payout needs (rule 8 grant); it is later than BlindBox's deployment.",
    "Loss is the payouts of the attacker's fallback-won bets net of those bets' stakes; wins on live blockhashes paid fair odds and are excluded, lost stakes are not subtracted. ATM is unpriced and its sale crashed the pool: valued at the nine refs disposals' USDT proceeds pro rata to ATM sold (rule 12).",
    "Separate incident from the other ATM records (Staking 0xa479 burnExpiredReward and ATM 0xa595 fee auto-swap): different tokens, deployers and defects. No earlier selective fallback settlement: before this attacker every expired bet was settled by another bettor's entry, at chance odds."
